          "content": "\n\n首先，我将添加一个可监控的任务包装器类：\n\n```java\n/**\n * 可监控的任务包装器\n */\npublic class MonitoredTask<T> implements Runnable, Callable<T> {\n    private final Callable<T> task;\n    private volatile int progress;\n    private volatile String status;\n    private volatile long startTime;\n    private volatile long timeout;\n    \n    public MonitoredTask(Callable<T> task, long timeout) {\n        this.task = task;\n        this.timeout = timeout;\n        this.progress = 0;\n        this.status = \"PENDING\";\n    }\n    \n    public void updateProgress(int progress, String status) {\n        this.progress = progress;\n        this.status = status;\n    }\n    \n    public int getProgress() {\n        return progress;\n    }\n    \n    public String getStatus() {\n        return status;\n    }\n    \n    public long getElapsedTime() {\n        return System.currentTimeMillis() - startTime;\n    }\n    \n    public long getRemainingTime() {\n        return timeout - getElapsedTime();\n    }\n    \n    @Override\n    public T call() throws Exception {\n        startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n        status = \"RUNNING\";\n        \n        FutureTask<T> future = new FutureTask<>(task);\n        Thread taskThread = new Thread(future);\n        taskThread.start();\n        \n        try {\n            return future.get(timeout, TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS);\n        } catch (TimeoutException e) {\n            future.cancel(true);\n            status = \"TIMEOUT\";\n            throw new TimeoutException(\"Task timed out after \" + timeout + \"ms\");\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            status = \"FAILED\";\n            throw e;\n        } finally {\n            status = \"COMPLETED\";\n        }\n    }\n    \n    @Override\n    public void run() {\n        try {\n            call();\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            throw new RuntimeException(e);\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n接下来，我将修改线程池工具类，添加相关方法：\n\n```java\n// 在NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil类